YASD Hea-Hum-Mal-Neu

After archeologist, barbarian and caveman I am trying to ascend a
healer. After lots of tries I got a game going, but that game just
ended in a quite spectacular failure: my powerful character died on
the Astral Plane, but more about that below.

Main points about the game:
- got petrified wizard in Minetown, main boon being his cloak of magic
protection
- got amulet of ESP, magic lamp, ring of polymorph control and slow
digestion fairly early
- identified a spellbook of identify, that one crumbled when I tried
to read it, fortunately there was another one in a shop
- in level below Minetown I ran into a silver dragon too powerful for
my poor healer to handle, so I retreated with my pets and did Sokoban
first and got reflection there
- with reflection and some levelling up I was able to defeat the
silver dragon, who was nice to drop scales, so I could go back to
wearing "oESP; I also had close call when accidentaly getting into a
polytrap - I got the "new man" effect and two XL levels up
- on the same place as the dragon I found gray stone, which I price-
id'ed to be a luckstone
- with luckstone I could skip the rest of mines, but I dived in anyway
because of pressing need for at least a sack
- the dive to lower mines paid off nicely: I got BoH, some scrolls and
even extra =oPC; in Mine's End I reached XL 13
- when I arrived at Castle, the first thing I saw was arch-lich next
to me, immediately using his touch of death on me; fortunately I
killed him easily on burned Elbereth
- polypiled rings in VoTD, got =oFA, but not the desired ring of
teleport control
- ate two rings of protection in vain attempt to rack some more AC
points; I made BIG mistake by eating ring of regeneration -- I did not
realize that regeneration means also hunger; fortunately, with =oSD it
wasn't much of a problem
- revgenocided tengus twice in the Castle to get intrinsic teleport
control
- at Baalzebub's level I found bones of a fully kitted archeologist
(with /oWishing, quest artifact, Grayswandir etc.)
- after thorough preparation I started the ascension run, which was
smooth until the Astral Plane
- on Astral I revgenocided purple worms twice, tamed them and
dispersed around with broken wand of teleportation
- the environment was dense and I wasn't using conflict; the first
altar was a struggle
- the second altar was already mostly cleared by my brave purple worm
friends; but still, crossaligned
- going back to last altar I run into Death (i killed him once
before); I started to melee him when suddenly I got DYWYPI -- I had no
idea what happened; he tried to use deadly touch before, why would it
work now? I had MR from CoMR, what could go wrong with that? After
glancing at the game dump, the fatal error on my part was revealed: I
had CoMR, but wasn't wearing it!!! I have taken it off somewhere
(possibly at Wizard's Tower to use found ?oEnchantArmor) and forgot to
put it back on). The whole ascension run from killing Rodney to Astral
Plane was MR-less! If I had little more luck with the high altars, I
could actually make it.


